message: "If you use this work, cite this repository edition and the relevant accepted scientific document versions separately. No DOI has been assigned."
title: "AtlasSAT-16U-SWM1: Souss Water Management 1 — spacecraft engineering demonstrator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ait Oubahou"
    given-names: "Wassim"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Public examples and engineering publications for the AtlasSAT orbital-analysis study.
  The archived agricultural baseline does not meet the 72-hour daylight
  revisit target. Included examples demonstrate controlled numerical
  methods and selected saved-event aggregation, not complete mission
  reproduction or operational validation.
keywords:
  - spacecraft mission analysis
  - GMAT
  - optical access
  - numerical verification
  - Earth observation
